>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MONSTER-DISTANCE.

DATA DIVISION.
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-DISPATCHES PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-VALIDATIONS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-ACTION PIC X(16).
01 LK-C-DAY.
   05 LC-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LC-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LC-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LC-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-T-DAY.
   05 LT-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LT-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LT-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LT-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-RESULT.
   05 LR-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LR-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LR-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LR-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
01 LK-MESSAGE PIC X(160).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING
    LK-ACTION LK-C-DAY LK-T-DAY LK-RESULT LK-STATUS LK-MESSAGE.
MAIN.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-STATUS LK-STATUS
    MOVE SPACES TO LK-MESSAGE
    ADD 1 TO WS-DISPATCHES
    EVALUATE FUNCTION TRIM(LK-ACTION)
        WHEN "DISTANCE-LEGACY"
            ADD 1 TO WS-VALIDATIONS
            IF LC-SIGN < -1 OR LC-SIGN > 1
               OR LT-SIGN < -1 OR LT-SIGN > 1
                MOVE 22 TO WS-STATUS
            ELSE
                IF LR-SIGN NOT = 0 OR LR-CHUNKS NOT = 0
                   OR LR-HEAD NOT = NULL OR LR-TAIL NOT = NULL
                    MOVE 175 TO WS-STATUS
                ELSE
                    CALL "LEGACY-DISTANCE" USING
                        LK-C-DAY LK-T-DAY LK-RESULT WS-STATUS
                END-IF
            END-IF
            IF WS-STATUS = 0
                MOVE "DISCOVERY03:DISTANCE-LEGACY" TO LK-MESSAGE
            ELSE
                MOVE "历史距离计算失败；输出槽或输入无效。" TO LK-MESSAGE
            END-IF
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 20 TO WS-STATUS
            MOVE "不支持的距离操作。" TO LK-MESSAGE
    END-EVALUATE
    MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM MONSTER-DISTANCE.
